        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An employee who fails to return to work from a leave of absence on the approved anticipated date of return or any approved extension shall be considered to have abandoned his/her job, in accordance with Article 33 - Resignation, if such failure to return exceeds five (5) consecutive working days of the anticipated return date.",
